From: Paul Scheduikat <luantak@pm.me>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:32:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] aggregate reflection names from object archives

Read per-package name records while loading the exact archives for the
link. Use one sorted table for internal/abi and for typelink sorting.
---
 cmd/link/internal/ld/data.go           | 26 +-----------
 cmd/link/internal/ld/garble_reflect.go | 56 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 cmd/link/internal/ld/lib.go            |  4 ++
 cmd/link/internal/ld/link.go           |  4 ++
 4 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/cmd/link/internal/ld/garble_reflect.go

